        "cooked": "<p>Best part - you don't have to.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\">  If you think someone deserves it, nominate them. Dupes don't hurt anything and just help to reinforce how much folks are appreciated.</p>\n<p>That's a great idea about multiple in one post, though - I'll go update the anonymous posts to combine them and make a note on the original posts.</p>",
